        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-702, Twisted Column Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe old world feel of the Twisted Cabinet Knob really comes to life with the fanciful design. It is available in 7 finishes and two sizes--a 2 inch and a 3-3/4 inch. The Twisted Column Cabinet Pull comes packaged with all the necessary hardware and features an easy screw-on design.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/twist-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-800\"><b>Twist Cabinet Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/12-inch-twisted-door-handle-rk-international-ph-4803\"><b>12 Inch Twist Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International Fancy Twisted Cabinet Pull with Urn Tips:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-702:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CK-701:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
